hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2153","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Faraez unkey haqdaaron se milao! Phir jo baaqi rahey wo qareebi mard key liye hai. (Bukhari: 6732)"
"2154","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se beti aur poti aur behan key baarey mein poochha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beti key liye aadha. Aur behan key liye aadha. Aur Ibn Masood key paas jao, wo meri mutabaat karega. To Ibn Masood se poochha gaya aur unhey Abu Musa key qaul ki khabar di gai. To unhon-ne kaha: Agar main gumraah hua to main hidaayat paaney walon mein se nahi hun. Main us mein faisla karta hun jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya: Beti key liye aadha aur poti key liye chhata, do tihaai poora karney key liye. Aur jo baaqi rahey wo behan key liye. To ham Abu Musa key paas aey aur unhey Ibn Masood key qaul ki khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Mujh se na poochho jab tak ye aalim tum mein hai. (Bukhari: 6736)"
"2155","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qaum ka aazaad karda un mein se hai. (Bukhari: 6761)"
"2156","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qaum key behan ka beta un mein se hai. Ya un mein se hai. (Bukhari: 6762)"
"2157","[AI-translation] Zaid key betey Usaama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman kaafir ka waaris nahi hota aur na kaafir Musalman ka waaris hota hai. (Bukhari: 6764). Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman kaafir ka waaris nahi hota aur na kaafir Musalman ka waaris hota hai. (6764). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2158","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apne baapon se beraghbati na karo! Phir jo apne baap se beraghbati karey wo kufr hai. (Bukhari: 6768). Hudood ki kitaab."
